WEBVTT

00:01.420 --> 00:03.050
Always keep a good poker face.

00:03.050 --> 00:04.760
Taking his father's teaching to heart...

00:04.760 --> 00:06.630
The miraculous magician glides amidst the skyscrapers.

00:06.630 --> 00:08.720
Kaitou Kid, prepare yourself!

00:09.390 --> 00:10.300
Akako!?

00:10.300 --> 00:13.140
Today's target is Kaito's heart!

01:42.230 --> 01:49.530
Detective Conan is brought to you by these sponsors.

01:55.910 --> 02:01.910
LOVE ON THE SKI SLOPE ON CHRISTMAS EVE

02:12.380 --> 02:13.510
O the Realm of Hell...

02:14.090 --> 02:16.430
Ye who dominate in tenebrosity...

02:16.430 --> 02:17.930
Bring me power...

02:18.220 --> 02:19.770
Bring me power.

02:30.780 --> 02:31.860
Completion!

02:36.030 --> 02:38.700
My pair of emblems infused with Red Magic.

02:39.080 --> 02:42.620
Any two people these are stuck on will fall in love at once...

02:42.620 --> 02:45.170
And unite to form partners without fail.

02:50.170 --> 02:55.300
Kuroba Kaito, I shall make you my slave once and for all.

02:58.850 --> 03:00.430
It's sunny!

03:00.430 --> 03:01.390
Right?

03:01.390 --> 03:04.690
A skiing class on Christmas, isn't this just marvelous?

03:04.690 --> 03:06.230
Right, marvelous indeed!

03:07.350 --> 03:10.190
I can picture the ski slope with the
stars raining down right now!

03:11.650 --> 03:12.530
Somehow...

03:12.530 --> 03:14.400
Sensei's the only one with maximum hype...

03:17.360 --> 03:18.570
Everyone's so happy.

03:19.200 --> 03:21.990
But Aoko doesn't know how to ski at all...

03:22.580 --> 03:23.830
Hey, Kaito.

03:25.790 --> 03:27.370
Did you know?

03:27.370 --> 03:29.130
They have hot springs there too.

03:29.130 --> 03:30.840
And it's mixed-bath!

03:30.840 --> 03:32.050
What!?

03:34.630 --> 03:36.090
What a carefree guy.

03:36.090 --> 03:38.470
Not knowing that he would ended up my captive in no time—

03:38.470 --> 03:39.350
Akako-sama!

03:39.720 --> 03:42.180
Would you please consider skiing with me!?

03:42.470 --> 03:43.350
Akako-sama, join me!

03:43.350 --> 03:43.930
No, join me!

03:43.930 --> 03:45.020
No, me!

03:51.020 --> 03:53.110
Gentlemen, go back to your seats!

04:14.300 --> 04:15.590
Get out of my way!

04:19.260 --> 04:20.550
Owww...

04:21.010 --> 04:23.010
No, no, not so fast!

04:33.400 --> 04:35.480
Bimbo, knock it off already!

04:35.730 --> 04:38.150
You've been crashing into me for a while now!

04:38.150 --> 04:40.700
It's not like I did it on purpose...

04:43.030 --> 04:45.410
You're so bad at this, it's almost painful.

04:46.410 --> 04:48.000
It can't be helped, can it?

04:48.000 --> 04:49.210
I'm just a beginner!

04:49.460 --> 04:50.710
Yo, a lover's quarrel again?

04:51.460 --> 04:52.880
Go ski over there!

04:52.880 --> 04:55.590
You're the one who should stay away from where Aoko is headed!

04:57.130 --> 04:58.590
What the heck are they doing?

05:01.260 --> 05:04.350
Nevertheless, that Nakamori Aoko...

05:04.350 --> 05:05.350
She's really an eyesore.

05:05.850 --> 05:08.850
Whenever I try to approach him, she's
always around him and in my way.

05:09.810 --> 05:10.890
Now!

05:11.400 --> 05:13.150
Everyone, attention please!

05:13.360 --> 05:17.860
All right, I've designed an exciting special event for this evening!

05:18.740 --> 05:19.530
An event?

05:19.530 --> 05:20.700
Haven't heard about any.

05:20.700 --> 05:22.240
Of course you haven't.

05:22.240 --> 05:23.490
I'm going to announce it now.

05:23.490 --> 05:24.370
OK?

05:24.370 --> 05:27.240
It's entitled, "The Holy Night Masquerade Skiing Contest".

05:27.240 --> 05:30.370
Every one of you should find a partner
and prepare to ski as a friendly <i>couple</i>.

05:31.920 --> 05:32.830
Couple?

05:32.830 --> 05:33.670
No kidding?

05:33.670 --> 05:36.170
Sensei, can't we ski together as two girls?

05:36.550 --> 05:37.170
You can't.

05:37.590 --> 05:40.220
By definition, a couple consists of a boy and a girl.

05:40.220 --> 05:43.590
Leaving two sets of ski tracks on
the ski slope bathing in twilight...

05:43.590 --> 05:45.600
There lies a world enough for only two.

05:45.600 --> 05:48.970
It's going to be an unforgettable page in your album of youth!

05:49.680 --> 05:51.600
Imagine how romantic that is!

05:51.810 --> 05:54.770
Sensei, I can see stars flying over your head...

05:54.770 --> 05:56.110
My, what do I do?

05:56.110 --> 05:58.030
<i>Bonne idée</i> if I do say so myself!

06:01.150 --> 06:01.740
That is all.

06:01.740 --> 06:03.410
Hustle up and decide who your partner will be.

06:03.950 --> 06:06.830
I've already prepared some costumes in the
lodge, so work on the details, everyone.

06:07.530 --> 06:10.120
There will be a prize for the winning couple!

06:11.250 --> 06:12.540
What do we do now?

06:13.460 --> 06:15.040
A partner, huh...

06:15.830 --> 06:18.550
I heard the other class is having a snowboard contest.

06:18.550 --> 06:21.050
Sheesh, I envy them...

06:26.140 --> 06:28.930
No way I'd pair up with a total noob like you, is there?

06:28.930 --> 06:29.470
Idiot!

06:32.230 --> 06:34.060
Nakamori-san, come here.

06:34.060 --> 06:34.940
Akako-chan!

06:36.360 --> 06:38.150
Nakamori-san...

06:38.150 --> 06:40.820
You like Kuroba-kun, don't you?

06:42.650 --> 06:43.950
No way!

06:43.950 --> 06:45.110
Oh, is that so?

06:45.860 --> 06:47.200
I do love him.

06:48.200 --> 06:52.370
Kuroba-kun is not as simple a person as you may think.

06:53.290 --> 06:55.210
What do you mean by that?

06:55.210 --> 06:58.170
He's more complicated, more incredible than that.

06:58.170 --> 06:59.090
Incredible?

06:59.090 --> 07:02.670
To sum it up, an ordinary person like
you is simply not suitable for him.

07:03.880 --> 07:06.800
How about it, want to have a bet with me?

07:06.800 --> 07:09.010
On which of us can get to pair up with him.

07:09.010 --> 07:11.390
The loser needs to gracefully give up on hi—

07:12.640 --> 07:13.980
Why are you laughing?

07:13.980 --> 07:16.310
Because this is too funny!

07:16.310 --> 07:20.150
To think a beauty like Akako-chan would
take a fancy to someone like Kaito!

07:20.150 --> 07:22.110
That Kaito guy sure is a lady magnet.

07:23.440 --> 07:24.570
You, miss...

07:24.570 --> 07:27.110
Say, say, what's so good about Kaito?

07:27.110 --> 07:28.450
Tell me, tell me!

07:28.450 --> 07:29.660
There's nothing good to say...

07:31.120 --> 07:33.000
Anyway, a bet is a bet!

07:33.000 --> 07:34.870
She's turning bright red.

07:34.870 --> 07:36.250
Akako-chan sure is cute!

07:37.460 --> 07:39.040
I see...

07:39.040 --> 07:40.130
I see, I se—

07:44.050 --> 07:45.380
I see...

07:51.970 --> 07:52.810
Fujie-kun!

07:53.020 --> 07:54.770
Akako-sama!

07:55.730 --> 07:57.190
Akako-chan...

07:57.190 --> 07:59.650
Fujie-kun, I didn't know you liked Akako-chan!

07:59.980 --> 08:01.520
I'm no good...

08:01.770 --> 08:04.360
I knew someone like me isn't good enough...

08:04.360 --> 08:07.570
I'm a nobody and I'm fat, not to mention my skiing skill sucks...

08:07.570 --> 08:10.620
And I tried to muster up my courage
and give it my best shot today!

08:11.120 --> 08:11.830
But...

08:12.080 --> 08:16.580
There's just no way any girl in the world would pair up with me!

08:16.580 --> 08:18.750
That's not—that's not true at all!

08:18.750 --> 08:19.580
But...

08:20.210 --> 08:21.250
In that case...

08:22.040 --> 08:23.550
Why don't you ski with Aoko?

08:24.550 --> 08:26.010
Noobs flock together.

08:26.010 --> 08:27.170
Let's do our best, 'kay?

08:27.760 --> 08:30.220
But Aoko-chan, you have Kaito...

08:30.220 --> 08:31.470
That's irrelevant.

08:31.470 --> 08:32.760
Kaito is with Aka—

08:32.760 --> 08:33.810
Never mind.

08:33.810 --> 08:35.680
I bet he'll be skiing with another pro.

08:40.100 --> 08:41.940
As usual, you're the bomb, Kaito!

08:45.860 --> 08:46.530
What?

08:48.200 --> 08:49.110
Me first!

08:49.820 --> 08:50.740
Later then!

08:51.490 --> 08:52.780
What's that for?

08:58.040 --> 08:59.580
As expected of Kuroba-kun.

09:00.210 --> 09:01.920
That was some magnificent skiing!

09:02.500 --> 09:03.500
Oh, Akako...

09:05.460 --> 09:07.130
I just don't get this girl...

09:08.130 --> 09:09.840
Owww...

09:09.840 --> 09:10.630
Again?

09:12.010 --> 09:15.260
Bimboko, you just won't get any better, will you?

09:15.640 --> 09:17.600
Kaito and... Akako-chan?

09:18.140 --> 09:19.770
Just hold your tongue!

09:20.310 --> 09:22.980
Aoko is doing her very best, you know?

09:23.860 --> 09:26.110
Why don't you go and make a snowman over there?

09:26.110 --> 09:27.230
What do you mean by that!?

09:30.490 --> 09:31.150
Fujie-kun?

09:34.070 --> 09:35.530
That reminds me, Aoko...

09:35.530 --> 09:36.830
You haven't decided yet, right?

09:37.240 --> 09:38.290
Decided what?

09:38.290 --> 09:41.250
You know, the pairing for the
whatchamacallit contest tonight.

09:41.710 --> 09:44.040
No choice here, I guess I'll just pair up with you!

09:49.260 --> 09:51.930
Aoko already made a promise to pair up with Fujie-kun.

09:51.930 --> 09:53.680
With Fujie, huh?

09:53.680 --> 09:54.850
Wait, who?

09:54.850 --> 09:56.560
Just told you, Aoko and...

09:57.180 --> 09:58.010
Fujie-kun.

10:04.730 --> 10:07.400
He's the right guy for you, Nakamori-san!

10:07.400 --> 10:09.190
Now, let's go!

10:16.370 --> 10:17.660
Bye then!

10:17.660 --> 10:21.040
You two should hit it off and build a snowman or something!

10:49.520 --> 10:50.940
What seems to be the matter?

10:50.940 --> 10:52.860
You've been tense for a while now.

10:52.860 --> 10:54.820
I'm not tense at all.

10:56.150 --> 10:57.690
What a cute guy!

10:57.690 --> 11:00.240
So do you accept the honor of pairing up with me?

11:00.240 --> 11:01.860
Yeah, whatever.

11:01.860 --> 11:02.870
Really?

11:03.620 --> 11:05.080
Look, my ski wear!

11:05.080 --> 11:05.910
Isn't it cute?

11:05.910 --> 11:07.500
Yeah, whatever.

11:09.750 --> 11:11.870
Look, what a spectacular view!

11:11.870 --> 11:13.460
Yeah, whatever.

11:15.750 --> 11:18.590
Don't tell me, this guy is not under my spell?

11:19.050 --> 11:20.550
Could he be <i>that</i> dense?

11:20.930 --> 11:22.130
Look at me right now!

11:23.180 --> 11:24.760
Seems as if you were away with the fairies.

11:25.180 --> 11:29.270
So the Almighty Kaitou Kid can't even get
a grip of himself with that girl around?

11:29.930 --> 11:31.980
I have no idea what you're talking about...

11:31.980 --> 11:34.520
Despite the fact I'm enlightening you with plain words?

11:35.110 --> 11:37.530
How about I pair up with you forever in that case?

11:38.110 --> 11:38.860
I get it!

11:38.860 --> 11:40.950
I get it—I'll pair with you!

11:40.950 --> 11:43.160
My, turning all red like that!

11:43.860 --> 11:46.740
So my magic emblem is indeed working.

11:47.160 --> 11:50.580
Sticking it on both of us will make us fall
for each other as partners without fail!

11:53.000 --> 11:54.120
This girl is...

11:54.460 --> 11:55.380
Not my thing...

12:02.590 --> 12:04.340
How boring...

12:04.760 --> 12:06.760
This is just boring as hell.

12:07.470 --> 12:08.760
Isn't this a mixed-bath?

12:08.760 --> 12:12.270
It's all right, I checked earlier and no one was here.

12:12.850 --> 12:14.230
Aoko, hurry.

12:14.230 --> 12:15.520
Hurry and dip in.

12:15.520 --> 12:17.150
Somehow my entire body hurts.

12:17.570 --> 12:18.980
﻿Aoko!

12:20.280 --> 12:21.070
This is bad...

12:22.490 --> 12:23.990
How soothing!

12:23.990 --> 12:24.990
Awesome!

12:27.700 --> 12:29.990
Hey, look, somebody's over there.

12:33.080 --> 12:36.380
No way, are you like, talking about me~?

12:36.380 --> 12:38.250
A cute husky voice!

12:38.250 --> 12:40.090
I see, so it's just a girl.

12:41.510 --> 12:45.090
Say, Aoko, why didn't you pair up with Kaito-kun?

12:45.090 --> 12:46.760
That's right, why didn't you?

12:46.760 --> 12:49.930
Because, Aoko is bad at skiing.

12:50.640 --> 12:52.680
Did you give up just because of that?

12:52.680 --> 12:54.690
Rather than giving up...

12:54.690 --> 12:56.150
It's more like Kaito's too good.

12:56.150 --> 12:58.810
If he were to ski with Aoko, he'd only embarrass himself.

12:58.810 --> 13:04.150
And here I thought Kaito was simply acting
as your personal coach and nothing more.

13:04.150 --> 13:05.360
Me too!

13:05.360 --> 13:08.620
But then again, why didn't Kaito invite you to pair up with him?

13:08.620 --> 13:10.700
Kaito is still like a child, don't you think?

13:10.990 --> 13:12.080
Well said!

13:12.080 --> 13:12.870
He's still a kid!

13:13.700 --> 13:15.040
That doesn't concern you lot at all...

13:15.790 --> 13:18.210
However, he still has some good in him.

13:18.790 --> 13:21.750
When Kaito was still a young boy, he lost his father.

13:21.750 --> 13:23.050
Aoko knows that.

13:24.050 --> 13:25.470
Kaito...

13:25.470 --> 13:27.300
Loved him very much...

13:30.300 --> 13:33.600
However, he's never shown a desolate expression.

13:33.600 --> 13:35.230
Doing stupid things all the time instead, right?

13:38.350 --> 13:40.520
That's why, how should I put it...

13:40.520 --> 13:42.650
As his childhood friend...

13:42.650 --> 13:45.950
Sometimes I do want Kaito to look cool and get all the glory.

13:48.570 --> 13:50.200
That's why this is fine by me, like this.

13:50.570 --> 13:51.530
Not fine at all!

13:51.530 --> 13:52.450
Ain't fine at all!

13:55.830 --> 13:57.080
Like, not fine at all...

14:04.250 --> 14:06.760
No way, something like <i>this</i>!

14:09.130 --> 14:09.970
So hot...

14:11.010 --> 14:13.390
Hold it, just keep still for a bit.

14:22.690 --> 14:25.150
What'd she mean by "this is fine by me"?

14:33.280 --> 14:34.370
What the hell's this?

14:39.670 --> 14:41.080
Is it really...

14:41.080 --> 14:42.420
Fine by me?

14:50.050 --> 14:51.390
Really...

14:51.390 --> 14:53.100
Am I all right with this?

15:10.700 --> 15:12.570
Kaitou Kid takes the stage!

15:16.330 --> 15:18.200
I bet that Aoko...

15:18.200 --> 15:21.870
Said something like it's a sure victory dressing
up like Kid and Inspector Nakamori, am I right?

15:22.670 --> 15:23.880
That's exactly right!

15:25.090 --> 15:27.590
But that belly of yours—is it bigger than usual?

15:29.970 --> 15:32.300
This is for Akako-sama.

15:32.300 --> 15:34.390
But I can't muster my courage...

15:34.600 --> 15:36.060
But, but...

15:36.060 --> 15:38.520
Aoko-chan gave me encouraging words.

15:38.520 --> 15:39.390
That's why...

15:39.890 --> 15:40.930
That's why...

15:42.270 --> 15:45.060
Aoko-chan actually wants to ski with you!

15:47.440 --> 15:48.480
Understood.

15:49.440 --> 15:50.650
Fujie, a present for you.

15:53.240 --> 15:53.780
Here.

15:55.370 --> 15:55.950
This is—!

15:56.870 --> 16:00.370
Now then, I'm gonna get a little busy!

16:01.410 --> 16:03.290
All right, everyone!

16:03.620 --> 16:07.750
Our Holy Night Masquerade Pair-Skiing
Contest is about to commence!

16:11.170 --> 16:14.130
I wonder where Fujie-kun went?

16:14.590 --> 16:16.850
Now, entry number one.

16:16.850 --> 16:18.890
The Panda Pair—Ling Ling and Shin Shin!

16:18.890 --> 16:20.680
Now, let's get started!

16:34.110 --> 16:36.240
Vampire and Werewolf!

16:36.450 --> 16:38.160
Doctor and Nurse!

16:40.290 --> 16:41.540
Octopus and Chicken!

16:44.710 --> 16:46.500
Dinosaur and Bug!

16:48.590 --> 16:50.670
Masked Yaiber and Monster!

16:53.760 --> 16:55.510
My, Nakamori-san.

16:57.470 --> 16:59.430
What happened to your partner?

17:00.010 --> 17:02.350
Anyhow, I've won the bet, haven't I?

17:02.930 --> 17:04.890
Entry number 18...

17:04.890 --> 17:06.810
Snow Queen and Yeti!

17:07.690 --> 17:09.110
Do your best, Kaito.

17:11.070 --> 17:13.190
Now, let's proceed, Kuroba-kun.

17:15.490 --> 17:18.490
Feast your eyes on our gorgeous skiing skills!

17:30.170 --> 17:31.550
Fujie-kun!?

17:31.550 --> 17:32.090
Why?

17:33.920 --> 17:35.050
Akako-sama...

17:42.350 --> 17:44.060
What's wrong with me?

17:44.060 --> 17:45.680
His image in my eyes...

17:46.140 --> 17:48.230
Somehow looks different than usual...

17:49.020 --> 17:50.190
Akako...

17:50.190 --> 17:51.610
As if he's radiating rays!

17:53.480 --> 17:54.530
Merry Christmas!

17:55.030 --> 17:56.110
For me?

17:56.110 --> 17:57.110
Yes!

17:57.110 --> 17:58.660
Thank you, Fujie-kun!

17:58.660 --> 18:00.450
Now, leave everything to me.

18:10.750 --> 18:13.170
Koizumi Akako, an impressive lead!

18:13.500 --> 18:15.630
That's the kind of pair-skiing I'm talking about!

18:15.630 --> 18:17.220
As expected of Akako-sama!

18:17.220 --> 18:19.130
Why isn't she with me?

18:19.720 --> 18:21.050
Thirty-nine points!

18:21.970 --> 18:23.890
It's the highest score!

18:23.890 --> 18:24.770
Fujie-kun!

18:25.220 --> 18:25.970
Akako-sama!

18:26.520 --> 18:28.480
Say, what happened to Aoko?

18:28.480 --> 18:29.900
Kaito hasn't shown up, either.

18:29.900 --> 18:31.440
Akako-sama!

18:31.440 --> 18:32.560
I expected no less!

18:32.810 --> 18:34.360
I wonder what they're doing?

18:34.360 --> 18:36.240
And the sun is setting too...

18:42.120 --> 18:44.580
Now I can't see anything at all...

18:48.080 --> 18:49.920
How come he didn't...

18:50.620 --> 18:52.710
Invite Aoko sooner?

18:56.420 --> 18:57.880
Kaito is...

18:57.880 --> 19:01.430
A STUPID JERK!

19:04.890 --> 19:07.390
Apologies for being a stupid jerk.

19:11.900 --> 19:13.190
Kaitou Kid!?

19:16.780 --> 19:17.610
Kaito...

19:17.610 --> 19:18.690
Is that you?

19:18.690 --> 19:21.490
Fujie just finished skiing with his idol Akako-sama.

19:21.780 --> 19:23.240
Kaito...

19:23.240 --> 19:24.740
You look just like the real Kid...

19:24.990 --> 19:26.120
Idiot!

19:26.120 --> 19:27.660
I'm way cooler than the real thing!

19:28.120 --> 19:30.910
However, can't you do something about it?

19:30.910 --> 19:32.330
Your costume.

19:32.330 --> 19:33.830
At least...

19:35.500 --> 19:37.670
Don't settle for less than this!

19:42.970 --> 19:44.720
Hey, did you just touch my butt!?

19:44.720 --> 19:45.930
I didn't touch anything.

19:46.930 --> 19:48.600
Now, let's kick this off.

19:48.600 --> 19:50.020
Last entry...

19:50.020 --> 19:51.850
Kaitou Kid and Princess Nakamori!

19:52.520 --> 19:54.350
But, Aoko can't ski...

19:54.520 --> 19:56.440
Wrong, Aoko can ski.

19:57.400 --> 20:00.940
You've already tumbled many times,
so you shouldn't be afraid, right?

20:00.940 --> 20:04.110
Just loosen up and picture yourself
skiing with confidence, you can do it!

20:07.280 --> 20:07.830
All right!

20:15.830 --> 20:17.090
It's Kaito!

20:17.090 --> 20:18.500
It's Kaito's magic!

20:31.640 --> 20:34.440
To think he'd intentionally disguise himself as Kaitou Kid...

20:34.440 --> 20:35.850
Such an insolent man...

20:43.240 --> 20:44.450
Oh boy!

20:49.870 --> 20:51.580
Here we go!

20:59.170 --> 21:00.590
Won with a perfect score!

21:00.590 --> 21:02.340
Kuroba Kaito and Nakamori Aoko!

21:07.340 --> 21:08.640
You did it, you did it!

21:11.560 --> 21:14.430
He defeated me entirely, that Kuroba Kaito...

21:14.430 --> 21:17.230
To think I was trapped in my own magic!

21:19.690 --> 21:22.230
But doesn't that mean my magic remains undefeated?

21:25.240 --> 21:26.780
Congratulations!

21:28.910 --> 21:30.410
Thank you, thank you!

21:32.160 --> 21:34.330
You're really clumsy!

21:34.330 --> 21:35.710
Why so harsh, geez...

21:36.830 --> 21:39.790
If you keep this up, you'll never be able to round me up.

21:41.420 --> 21:42.300
<i>Inspector</i>.

21:44.130 --> 21:47.550
Kaitou Kid, I'll apprehend you this time for sure!

21:51.140 --> 21:53.810
What's the meaning of this...

22:06.070 --> 22:06.950
This is...

22:07.200 --> 22:09.870
It's my handmade Akako-sama figurine.

22:13.540 --> 22:14.490
Akako-sama!

22:16.120 --> 22:18.540
Merry Christmas, Akako-sama!

22:18.540 --> 22:20.290
Please accept my present!

22:20.290 --> 22:22.130
Mine too, Akako-sama!

22:22.590 --> 22:23.800
Please accept!

22:23.800 --> 22:25.130
Akako-sama!

22:40.730 --> 22:42.270
Merry Christmas!

24:05.940 --> 24:17.580
NEXT EPISODE

24:06.690 --> 24:08.610
It's only the beginning of the new year and I already caught a cold.

24:09.070 --> 24:11.900
However, a case waits for no one even at a time like this.

24:11.900 --> 24:13.990
The truth hidden behind the video call.

24:13.990 --> 24:16.410
Is our wolf-crier really telling lies?

24:18.080 --> 24:20.950
GRABBING KARUTA CARDS IN DIRE STRAITS

24:18.080 --> 24:20.950
(PART ONE)

24:21.790 --> 24:29.420
